<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SPANISH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SPANISH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARY.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish first division summary on Monday: Espanyol 2 (Miguel Angel Benitez 16, Nicolas Ouedec 40 - pen) Sporting Gijon 3 (Francisco Villaroya 67, Jesus Velasco 80, Ricardo Bango 90). Halftime 2-0. Attendance 15,000.</p>
